        "Title": "HOW TO USE  -  1st run: leave the file empty -> <project>_PROJECT_SETUP.xlsx is made next to the .rvt from the Revit project information\nThen Browse... to that Excel.  Fill PROJECT (name, number, client, ISO codes, units, starting view) and PARAMETERS (Status, Revision ... ready).\nSave + close the Excel, Run -> Project Information, shared parameters, units and starting view are set.  Run again any time - never duplicates.",
